{"3970750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravity Game", "steam_appid": 3970750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4257720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Game is a puzzle-style infinite physics simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I originally made this as a physics demonstration for a final project in college, but it was so fun to watch the rocket fly around, that I decided to turn it into a game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can advance infinitely through the levels, each level adding on planet, and scaling the world to accommodate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard mode kicks things up a notch by adding movement to the planets. GOOD LUCK! My record is level 3...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are tasked with escaping your home planet, and reaching the goal at another! This game uses real Newtonian Physics in a simple 2D simulation, as a way to help people visually understand the mechanics. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity Game is a puzzle-style infinite physics simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I originally made this as a physics demonstration for a final project in college, but it was so fun to watch the rocket fly around, that I decided to turn it into a game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can advance infinitely through the levels, each level adding on planet, and scaling the world to accommodate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard mode kicks things up a notch by adding movement to the planets. GOOD LUCK! My record is level 3...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are tasked with escaping your home planet, and reaching the goal at another! This game uses real Newtonian Physics in a simple 2D simulation, as a way to help people visually understand the mechanics. </p>", "short_description": "Gravity Game is a puzzle-style infinite physics simulation. You are tasked with escaping yo